PingCraft

PingCraft's server stack (deploy/compose.yaml) runs the following programs as separate, unmodified upstream
container images. None of their code is part of PingCraft, and PingCraft does not build or redistribute them
(docs/adr/0002-agpl-bridges-at-arms-length.md). Each is under its own licence; its source is at the address
given.

- tuwunel, Matrix homeserver. Apache-2.0.
  Source: https://github.com/matrix-construct/tuwunel
- mautrix-telegram, Matrix-Telegram bridge. AGPL-3.0.
  Source: https://github.com/mautrix/telegram
- mautrix-signal, Matrix-Signal bridge. AGPL-3.0. It includes libsignal (AGPL-3.0).
  Source: https://github.com/mautrix/signal and https://github.com/signalapp/libsignal
- mautrix-whatsapp, Matrix-WhatsApp bridge. AGPL-3.0. It includes whatsmeow (MPL-2.0).
  Source: https://github.com/mautrix/whatsapp and https://github.com/tulir/whatsmeow
- Caddy, reverse proxy. Apache-2.0.
  Source: https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy
- PostgreSQL, database for the bridges. PostgreSQL License.
  Source: https://www.postgresql.org/ftp/source/
